# STATION 7: objectives (start, state) and reputation (change, read, rank).
npc: @test_progress
title: Station 7 - Objectives and reputation
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 7: Progress. Objective_Gather is currently "{objective("Objective_Gather")}". Reputation with my group (LowTalk_Testers): {reputation()}, rank "{rank()}" (expect LowTalk_Disliked below 0, LowTalk_Neutral 0-19, LowTalk_Liked at 20+).
-> Start Objective_Gather (expect a "New objective" line and objective state "active" on the next menu)
    <<set $started_objective = true>>
    <<objective Objective_Gather>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Reputation +10 (expect the number above to rise by 10 on the next menu; rank changes at 20)
    <<set $praises = $praises + 1>>
    <<reputation +10>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Reputation -10
    <<reputation -10>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Only visible when the objective is active <<if objective("Objective_Gather") == "active">>
    Correct: the objective is active.
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
